[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 60.15, "timestamp": "00:01:00", "text": "それは何ですか？最高のセット。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 63.99, "timestamp": "00:01:03", "text": "スーパーチャット。あなたは、あなたは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 68.149, "timestamp": "00:01:08", "text": "君は「オーマイゴッド」が下手だね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 70.71000000000001, "timestamp": "00:01:10", "text": "私はそれを読みません。何が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 72.39, "timestamp": "00:01:12", "text": "続いている。楽しんでいる限り"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 74.23, "timestamp": "00:01:14", "text": "あなた自身。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 84.95, "timestamp": "00:01:24", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 86.789, "timestamp": "00:01:26", "text": "待って。なぜ私はそれを削除したのか？なぜ私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 96.22999999999999, "timestamp": "00:01:36", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 104.149, "timestamp": "00:01:44", "text": "それは面倒だ。ああ、なんてことだ。彼女はできない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 112.03999999999999, "timestamp": "00:01:52", "text": "なんてこった、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 115.67, "timestamp": "00:01:55", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 119.53, "timestamp": "00:01:59", "text": "キツネがいる。なぜ削除したのですか？何てことだ。"}]